# Aletheia

Multi-agent AI fact-checking system built at Deep Hackathon (Finalist). Uses
LangGraph and FastAPI to run parallel evidence analysis across sources, with
Aptos for on-chain verification.

Runs 3 concurrent LangGraph agents for parallel evidence gathering — fact-checks claims against multiple sources simultaneously.
